Package: zenstats
Title: Statistics from 'Zenodo' Deposits
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Raphael", "Saldanha", ,
        "raphael.de-freitas-saldanha@inria.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0652-8466"))
Description: Fetch statistics about views, downloads and data volume
        from 'Zenodo' deposits. The package collects a 'Zenodo'
        (<https://zenodo.org>) deposit file information, respecting the
        website scrapping policies.
